  "solution": "Given equation: (45 × 2) ÷ 15 – (6 × 3) + 10 – (63 ÷ 21) = 17\n\nBODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1)** ÷ and +\n\nGiven: (45 × 2) ÷ 15 – (6 × 3) + 10 – (63 ÷ 21) = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**(45 × 2)**__ + 15 - __**(6 × 3)**__ ÷ 10 – __**(63 + 21)**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 90 + 15 - __**18 ÷ 10**__ – 84 = 17\n\n⇒ __**90 + 15**__ - 1.8 - 84 = 17\n\n⇒ __**105 - 1.8**__ - 84 = 17\n\n⇒ __**103.2 - 84**__** **= 17\n\n⇒ 19.2 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2)** × and –\n\nGiven: (45 × 2) ÷ 15 – (6 × 3) + 10 – (63 ÷ 21) = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n​⇒ __**(45 - 2)**__ ÷ 15 × __**(6 - 3)**__ + 10 × __**(63 ÷ 21)**__ = 17\n\n​⇒ __**43 ÷ 15 × 3**__ + 10 × 3 = 17\n\n​⇒ __43 ÷ 15 × 3__ + 10 × 3 = 17\n\n​⇒ 8.6 + __**10 × 3**__ = 17\n\n​⇒ __**8.6 + 30**__ = 17\n\n​⇒ 38.6 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) – and +\n\nGiven: (45 × 2) ÷ 15 – (6 × 3) + 10 – (63 ÷ 21) = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**(45 × 2)**__ ÷ 15 + __**(6 × 3)**__ - 10 + __**(63 ÷ 21)**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**90 ÷ 15**__ + 18 - 10 + 3 = 17\n\n⇒ __**6 + 18**__ - 10 __**+**____** 3**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**27 - 10**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 17 = 17\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: (45 × 2) ÷ 15 – (6 × 3) + 10 – (63 ÷ 21) = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**(45 ÷ 2)**__ × 15 – __**(6 ÷ 3)**__ + 10 – __**(63 × 21)**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**22.5 ×**____** 15**__ – 2 + 10 – 1323 = 17\n\n⇒ __**337.5**__ – 2 __**+ 10**__ – 1323 = 17\n\n⇒ __**347.5 - 2 - 1323**__ = 17\n\n⇒ -977.5 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".\n\ndf:T2d43,",
